This module contains a Go translation of the IBM Accurate Mathematical Library
from GNU libc 2.39, sysdeps/ieee754/dbl-64:

s_sin.c, sincostab.c, branred.c, branred.h, usncs.h,
s_tan.c, utan.h, utan.tbl,
e_asin.c, uasncs.h, asincos.tbl, root.tbl, powtwo.tbl,
s_atan.c, atnat.h, uatan.tbl,
e_atan2.c, atnat2.h, dla.h, mydefs.h.

